        "title": "Ask a yes-no question with 吗",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Keep statement order and add 吗 at the end to ask a yes-or-no question. Answer by repeating or negating the relevant predicate; a positive and a negative reply must fit what was asked.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你也学中文吗？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ yě xué Zhōngwén ma ？",
                "meaning": "Do you study Chinese too?",
